{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年47歲無業男涉於18年前兩度與14歲女童非法性交，另涉企圖強姦而被控3罪；</p><p>案件今（4日）於觀塘裁判法院首度提堂。</p><p>署理主任裁判官李志豪押後案件至12月14日再訊，屆時將在東區裁判法院處理交付高院審訊的程序，被告獲准以1萬元保釋。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:22.994744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:14:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:20.229937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.595814+00:00","content_hash":"8d52780e330fd8e3fab09aaa0d4017d9d486b34c7b3ed81ba0a280b68df88d25","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}